国的高级官职，负责军事和行政事务，此处指白起担任此职，在上下文中表示他作为秦军统帅伐魏。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"秦大良造白起","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"93074c46-87b9-4f3b-9dd1-9cbbd5089140"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"客卿","official_note":"客卿是战国时期秦国授予外国人才的官职，表示错作为客卿参与军事行动，在上下文中辅助白起伐魏。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"客卿錯","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"3aabd8d7-55f0-42b5-a63b-f22c98f13c22"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-332,"link_death_year":-257,"link_td_description":"白起，芈姓白氏，郿县人，战国时代军事家、秦国名将，兵家代表人物。担任秦国将领30多年，攻城70余座，被封为武安君。","link_td_id":"Q10008015","link_td_number_id":19391,"people_name":"白起","people_name_jianti_auto":"白起","people_xingming":"白起","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4b8-db0e-11ef-bc1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"司马错，周程伯休父之后，战国时期的秦国将领，秦灭蜀之役的统帅。","link_td_id":"Q10004245","link_td_number_id":390643,"people_name":"錯","people_name_jianti_auto":"错","people_xingming":"司马错","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4b9-db0e-11ef-a6c9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4ba-db0e-11ef-b66e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":1,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4bb-db0e-11ef-bc29-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"軹","place_name_jianti_auto":"轵","place_note":"河南濟源东南","resolved_place_entity_id":3428,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4bc-db0e-11ef-abab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉置垣县。后汉延平元年，垣山崩，即垣县山也。徐广曰：垣县...","context_before":"...，故魏邑也。一名王垣。《史记》：魏武侯二年，城安邑王垣。","source_end_index":70,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"91a9c931-594e-597f-897b-c2a67a0eecdf","source_start_index":40,"source_text":"又秦昭襄十五年，大梁造白起攻魏取垣，复与之。十八年，复取垣。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉县，文帝封薄昭为轵侯。建武三年，吴汉等击青犊于轵西，破...","context_before":"...：秦下轵道、南阳而伐魏。又苏厉曰：齐反温、轵、高平于魏。","source_end_index":72,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9bed0e43-0f4c-5e03-9e47-84161658ad03","source_start_index":56,"source_text":"秦昭王十六年，伐魏，取轵，是也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1秦大良造白起、客卿錯伐魏，至軹，取城大小六十一。","content_fanyi":"秦国大良造白起和客卿司马错率军攻打魏国，推进到轵地，夺取大小城邑六十一座。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦大良造白起、客卿错伐魏，至轵，取城大小六十一。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":326,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4ae-db0e-11ef-ab34-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二十六年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二十六年","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4ac-db0e-11ef-abd3-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（壬申、前二八九）","year_int":-289},"message":"success","success":true}